dsh: reasoning:
Confirmed empirically:
- `_class_tokens` matches only 4-group tokens. `AF-WCC-VAC-GEN` and `AF-WCC-SCALAR-SPH` (2 of 4 frozen ids) are not matched.
- `findings_for_text` therefore does not flag unknown 3-group tokens like `AF-WCC-VAC-NEW` or `AF-SCC-VAC-GEN` (SCC 3-group!) — wait, "AF-SCC-VAC-GEN" is 3 groups after AF- (SCC, VAC, GEN) and it's not flagged either. So the blind spot is not WCC-specific; it's any class token with only 3 hyphen groups. Note `AF-WCC-VAC-BH-FORM` is 4 groups and flagged.

